
% Drive By

a: vi | IV | I | V |
link: vi | IV | I | V |
In: vi |
Vr: $a*2
b: ii | IV | vi | V |
b_cad: ii | IV | vi | III |
PCh: $b $b_cad
c: IV | I | V | vi | V |
c_cad: IV | I | V | III |
c_turnaround: IV | I | ii | III |
cc: $c $c_cad
cc_turnaround: $c $c_turnaround
Ch: $cc $cc_turnaround
bridge: iii | vi | ii | V | III | ii | V |
ending: IV |
S: [E] $In $Vr $PCh $Ch $Vr $PCh $Ch $bridge $link $Ch*2 $ending
